This question probes building a scalable, secure real-time ingestion path with strict tenant isolation and practical trade-offs in GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant isolation via per-tenant datasets and KMS keys
- Streaming processing with Pub/Sub and Dataflow/Beam
- Exactly-once or idempotent writes with dedup tokens
- Observability with Cloud Logging/Monitoring and alerts
- Backpressure, burst handling, and cost controls

